1
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:23,347
♪Where can love ever be whole?♪

2
00:00:23,372 --> 00:00:27,874
♪When will the bright moon be full?♪

3
00:00:28,268 --> 00:00:30,609
♪Love and hate turn on a single thought♪

4
00:00:30,634 --> 00:00:35,366
♪The past is hard to leave, part,
or sever♪

5
00:00:35,497 --> 00:00:38,755
♪My true heart has never changed♪

6
00:00:40,008 --> 00:00:42,699
♪I wish to become paired swallows
with you♪

7
00:00:43,518 --> 00:00:48,290
♪To meet year after year♪

8
00:00:53,205 --> 00:00:55,734
=Phoenix Rising from the Faint Moon=

9
00:00:55,759 --> 00:00:58,511
(Adapted from the Fanqie Novel
Heaven-Sent Consort & Scheming Prince)

10
00:00:58,523 --> 00:00:59,521
(Author: Yun Jinque)

11
00:01:01,052 --> 00:01:04,114
=Episode 4=

12
00:01:19,059 --> 00:01:20,660
Did you sleep well, my princess consort?

13
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:26,900
You... Why are you here?

14
00:01:27,139 --> 00:01:28,780
What are you doing in my room so early?

15
00:01:29,340 --> 00:01:31,340
Perhaps you should take a closer look

16
00:01:31,619 --> 00:01:32,979
and see whose room this is.

17
00:01:37,459 --> 00:01:39,834
(Oh no. Why did I fall asleep?)

18
00:01:39,860 --> 00:01:41,979
(Feng Qingyun is going to hate me
for this.)

19
00:01:45,979 --> 00:01:48,019
Let me remind you, my princess consort.

20
00:01:48,499 --> 00:01:52,059
I own Yunshui Teahouse.

21
00:01:52,340 --> 00:01:55,220
If you ever plot against me again,

22
00:01:55,900 --> 00:01:58,180
pick a place that isn't mine.

23
00:02:02,380 --> 00:02:03,740
So you knew all along.

24
00:02:03,820 --> 00:02:05,660
You were just here enjoying the show.

25
00:02:05,740 --> 00:02:07,099
Your clumsy acting

26
00:02:07,499 --> 00:02:09,820
has actually given me
quite a bit of amusement.

27
00:02:10,220 --> 00:02:11,220
You...

28
00:02:12,419 --> 00:02:14,019
As for the poisoning,

29
00:02:14,059 --> 00:02:16,860
I can be magnanimous and let it slide.

30
00:02:17,059 --> 00:02:20,340
But you have to tell me

31
00:02:20,700 --> 00:02:22,579
what this is

32
00:02:23,139 --> 00:02:24,300
and where it came from.

33
00:02:25,780 --> 00:02:27,019
It's a recording pen.

34
00:02:27,019 --> 00:02:28,939
I just tinkered with it
in my spare time.

35
00:02:29,059 --> 00:02:30,820
What? You want it?

36
00:02:34,579 --> 00:02:35,900
You really do want it?

37
00:02:39,780 --> 00:02:40,459
How about this?

38
00:02:40,820 --> 00:02:42,900
Cancel 500 taels of my debt,

39
00:02:43,180 --> 00:02:44,939
and I'll give it to you as a gift.

40
00:02:45,180 --> 00:02:46,780
But if I'm paying,

41
00:02:47,260 --> 00:02:49,380
how can you call it a gift?

42
00:02:49,619 --> 00:02:52,220
This thing can't be made in your era.

43
00:02:53,180 --> 00:02:54,380
So? Do you want it or not?

44
00:02:54,380 --> 00:02:55,660
Five hundred taels is a bargain.

45
00:03:00,459 --> 00:03:01,539
Three hundred taels.

46
00:03:03,939 --> 00:03:04,780
Four hundred taels.

47
00:03:04,780 --> 00:03:05,419
Two hundred taels.

48
00:03:08,900 --> 00:03:10,180
Three hundred taels.

49
00:03:10,180 --> 00:03:11,220
One hundred taels.

50
00:03:13,900 --> 00:03:15,740
Two hundred taels it is then.

51
00:03:16,300 --> 00:03:17,900
Not a tael less.

52
00:03:19,340 --> 00:03:20,660
So, payment and goods settled.

53
00:03:20,660 --> 00:03:22,099
I still owe you 2,300 taels.

54
00:03:22,099 --> 00:03:22,939
Wait.

55
00:03:25,380 --> 00:03:28,340
You still haven't told me
how to use this thing.

56
00:03:41,019 --> 00:03:43,260
That's enough. Figure it out yourself.

57
00:03:43,260 --> 00:03:44,459
Figure it out yourself.

58
00:04:04,756 --> 00:04:07,805
(Grand Tutor's Residence)

59
00:04:22,700 --> 00:04:24,820
So you finally remembered me today,
Weiyue.

60
00:04:27,419 --> 00:04:29,099
Something came up yesterday.

61
00:04:30,019 --> 00:04:31,820
I didn't have time to update you.

62
00:04:32,012 --> 00:04:35,173
I'm sorry. I didn't think it through
this time.

63
00:04:36,499 --> 00:04:38,180
You didn't think it through,

64
00:04:38,340 --> 00:04:40,780
and I waited six whole hours
for nothing.

65
00:04:44,340 --> 00:04:45,539
It's my fault.

66
00:04:45,860 --> 00:04:47,180
I underestimated Mo Yuya.

67
00:04:47,860 --> 00:04:48,900
Don't worry.

68
00:04:48,939 --> 00:04:52,539
I'll find another chance for you
to see Mo Yuya again.

69
00:04:53,660 --> 00:04:55,139
Do you now feel

70
00:04:55,780 --> 00:04:57,860
nothing at all for him?

71
00:05:05,499 --> 00:05:06,939
(Young pretty boy,)

72
00:05:09,019 --> 00:05:11,059
(I love you.)

73
00:05:12,900 --> 00:05:13,539
Weiyue.

74
00:05:14,700 --> 00:05:15,340
Weiyue?

75
00:05:16,419 --> 00:05:17,979
Yes, nothing at all.

76
00:05:18,180 --> 00:05:19,019
Besides,

77
00:05:19,260 --> 00:05:20,380
Mo Yuya will only ever be yours.

78
00:05:20,499 --> 00:05:21,459
He has nothing to do with me.

79
00:05:22,180 --> 00:05:24,539
Just please spare me and don't kill me.

80
00:05:25,139 --> 00:05:26,579
What?

81
00:05:27,459 --> 00:05:28,459
It's nothing, Qingyun.

82
00:05:28,740 --> 00:05:30,180
Let's keep in touch.

83
00:05:30,499 --> 00:05:31,619
Whenever there's a chance,

84
00:05:31,700 --> 00:05:33,380
I'll arrange for you and Mo Yuya
to be alone.

85
00:05:33,780 --> 00:05:35,419
Then you just have to make your move.

86
00:05:35,419 --> 00:05:36,979
You can do it!

87
00:05:38,260 --> 00:05:39,139
Bye.

88
00:05:41,220 --> 00:05:43,820
(Feng Weiyue spent the night
with Yuya yesterday.)

89
00:05:44,860 --> 00:05:47,459
(And today she's still trying to fool me
with sweet talk.)

90
00:05:48,499 --> 00:05:50,860
(You say one thing to my face
and do another behind my back.)

91
00:05:51,059 --> 00:05:52,780
(Why would I ever trust you again?)

92
00:05:52,780 --> 00:05:53,380
(Speed up the plan.)

93
00:05:53,380 --> 00:05:55,019
(Take Feng Weiyue's life at once.)
Only if you die

94
00:05:56,300 --> 00:05:59,780
(will it be the best guarantee of
helping me become princess consort.)

95
00:06:00,736 --> 00:06:03,486
(Instant Noodles)

96
00:06:05,900 --> 00:06:06,890
(Travelers passing by all love
the smell of instant noodles.)

97
00:06:07,500 --> 00:06:08,150
(Luzhuo Spring Water
Master Feng's Instant Noodles)

98
00:06:09,372 --> 00:06:10,106
(Master Feng)

99
00:06:10,118 --> 00:06:11,160
(Crazy Good Noodle House)

100
00:06:13,023 --> 00:06:13,958
(Crazy Good Noodle House)

101
00:06:13,983 --> 00:06:14,445
(Instant Noodles)

102
00:06:15,468 --> 00:06:16,329
(Crazy Good Noodle House)

103
00:06:17,579 --> 00:06:19,139
We're open!

104
00:06:19,539 --> 00:06:20,698
Everyone, folks,

105
00:06:20,820 --> 00:06:24,180
Master Feng's Crazy Good Noodle House
is officially open today!

106
00:06:26,099 --> 00:06:28,380
Buy one, get one free.
Making a living isn't easy.

107
00:06:28,539 --> 00:06:29,820
Handsome, want some noodles?

108
00:06:38,539 --> 00:06:39,539
Buy one, get two free.

109
00:06:39,740 --> 00:06:41,139
Buy one, get three free.

110
00:06:41,408 --> 00:06:43,276
(Crime Investigation Area. Keep Away.
Court of Judicial Review)

111
00:06:43,300 --> 00:06:44,579
Don't miss out!

112
00:06:44,939 --> 00:06:46,220
We're open!

113
00:06:46,410 --> 00:06:48,410
(Chunya Teahouse)

114
00:06:48,499 --> 00:06:50,900
No customers. Perfect.

115
00:06:51,740 --> 00:06:52,579
Thank you.

116
00:06:53,539 --> 00:06:54,619
It's nothing.

117
00:06:54,979 --> 00:06:56,139
No need to be so courteous,
Your Highness.

118
00:06:57,139 --> 00:07:00,139
So Your Highness and your wife

119
00:07:00,220 --> 00:07:02,459
(Yan Qi, Assistant Minister)
aren't as cold as the rumors say.

120
00:07:02,939 --> 00:07:04,780
Someone from Xingzhao Pavilion
has shown up.

121
00:07:05,380 --> 00:07:06,380
Their target is Feng Weiyue.

122
00:07:07,820 --> 00:07:09,059
Use her as bait.

123
00:07:09,619 --> 00:07:10,780
Follow the trail to the source.

124
00:07:11,638 --> 00:07:12,363
Ma'am.

125
00:07:12,700 --> 00:07:14,860
No wonder you won't let customers
into her shop.

126
00:07:15,579 --> 00:07:18,139
But are you sure
Xingzhao Pavilion will come?

127
00:07:19,300 --> 00:07:20,619
When have the Xingzhao Pavilion members

128
00:07:21,459 --> 00:07:23,820
(Crime Investigation Area. Keep Away.)
ever respected the court?

129
00:07:29,180 --> 00:07:30,220
I'm doomed.

130
00:07:31,419 --> 00:07:32,780
It's all over.

131
00:07:33,099 --> 00:07:35,300
The bigger the noodle shop,
the faster it goes under.

132
00:07:35,300 --> 00:07:37,400
(Guangfu Inn)

133
00:07:38,139 --> 00:07:40,459
I'll lose every coin I made
selling instant noodles.

134
00:07:46,979 --> 00:07:47,860
Ma'am,

135
00:07:48,260 --> 00:07:49,539
one bowl of noodles, please.

136
00:07:55,459 --> 00:07:57,434
The noodle shop closed
three minutes ago.

137
00:07:57,459 --> 00:07:59,180
There's a steamed bun shop to the left
outside.

138
00:07:59,579 --> 00:08:00,419
Hey, you...

139
00:08:01,459 --> 00:08:02,499
It's you!

140
00:08:04,499 --> 00:08:05,380
It's you?

141
00:08:05,900 --> 00:08:07,019
You transmigrated too?

142
00:08:09,139 --> 00:08:10,019
Ye!

143
00:08:10,099 --> 00:08:10,780
You came through too?

144
00:08:10,780 --> 00:08:11,700
I came through too.

145
00:08:23,860 --> 00:08:24,780
Ye?

146
00:08:25,379 --> 00:08:26,460
Ye!

147
00:08:30,059 --> 00:08:32,979
Boss, can you get me
a bowl of noodles first?

148
00:08:33,420 --> 00:08:35,379
I haven't eaten in three days.

149
00:08:35,379 --> 00:08:36,780
Alright, hang in there.

150
00:08:36,860 --> 00:08:37,660
Don't blame me.

151
00:08:39,979 --> 00:08:40,780
Hey, boss,

152
00:08:41,259 --> 00:08:43,059
give me a deluxe set.

153
00:08:43,379 --> 00:08:45,259
Five fried eggs.

154
00:08:48,379 --> 00:08:49,379
Aren't I good to you?

155
00:08:49,979 --> 00:08:50,979
That's the taste!

156
00:08:54,019 --> 00:08:54,979
Hey, boss,

157
00:08:55,179 --> 00:08:57,059
so you're the boy-crazy princess consort

158
00:08:57,099 --> 00:08:58,059
from the Imperial City legend?

159
00:08:58,179 --> 00:08:59,540
I thought you just had the same name.

160
00:09:00,339 --> 00:09:00,979
Boss,

161
00:09:01,259 --> 00:09:02,059
did you develop

162
00:09:02,379 --> 00:09:04,339
these instant noodles in ancient times?

163
00:09:05,740 --> 00:09:07,939
They're just from
that stupid dimensional product

164
00:09:08,259 --> 00:09:08,979
I brought over.

165
00:09:10,820 --> 00:09:11,540
You mean this?

166
00:09:14,900 --> 00:09:15,979
That's great, boss.

167
00:09:16,259 --> 00:09:18,580
Do you remember
when we were developing it,

168
00:09:18,580 --> 00:09:19,914
for storage capacity,

169
00:09:19,939 --> 00:09:22,059
we put everything in it,
including gunpowder,

170
00:09:22,059 --> 00:09:24,500
everything from every trade?

171
00:09:25,139 --> 00:09:26,620
Oh my.

172
00:09:27,620 --> 00:09:31,166
Now we can go wild with our cheats!

173
00:09:31,540 --> 00:09:34,339
I can, not we can.

174
00:09:35,379 --> 00:09:36,019
Boss,

175
00:09:36,620 --> 00:09:37,820
don't worry.

176
00:09:37,900 --> 00:09:39,500
As long as we stay in this other world,

177
00:09:39,820 --> 00:09:40,820
I'll stick with you.

178
00:09:40,939 --> 00:09:42,139
You'll protect me.

179
00:09:43,339 --> 00:09:44,900
You get the main profit,
and I'll get the cuts.

180
00:09:46,500 --> 00:09:47,500
Deal.

181
00:09:49,540 --> 00:09:50,540
Your Highness.

182
00:09:57,179 --> 00:09:57,979
Your Highness,

183
00:09:58,099 --> 00:09:59,259
someone from Xingzhao Pavilion
has shown up.

184
00:10:00,900 --> 00:10:01,460
Let's go.

185
00:10:21,900 --> 00:10:24,958
♪Dazzling my eyes, impossible to clear♪

186
00:10:25,240 --> 00:10:27,609
♪Mist and clouds lock the frosty sky♪

187
00:10:29,217 --> 00:10:31,661
♪Moon waxes and wanes,
true and false blur♪

188
00:10:32,055 --> 00:10:34,506
♪Coming near, then drifting far♪

189
00:10:35,469 --> 00:10:38,408
♪My heart knows it three thousand times♪

190
00:10:38,900 --> 00:10:41,540
♪Flowers mirrored in clear
shallow water♪

191
00:10:42,219 --> 00:10:46,790
♪Black hair spinning a cocoon,
I step toward love's abyss♪

192
00:10:49,684 --> 00:10:52,040
♪Sword in hand, I spur my horse on♪

193
00:10:52,740 --> 00:10:55,060
♪Love and duty cannot both be whole♪

194
00:10:56,601 --> 00:10:59,165
♪Troubles within and without,
home and realm in peril♪

195
00:10:59,608 --> 00:11:01,790
♪Scattered before my eyes♪

196
00:11:03,066 --> 00:11:05,901
♪Wind and snow cannot blow away
my longing♪

197
00:11:06,441 --> 00:11:08,790
♪Letting go is a kind of fulfillment♪

198
00:11:09,326 --> 00:11:10,653
♪This love remains unchanged♪

199
00:11:10,678 --> 00:11:13,790
♪Yet under the moon I make empty wishes♪

200
00:11:15,795 --> 00:11:18,260
♪Ask not of love's poison,
yearning cannot be cut♪

201
00:11:18,381 --> 00:11:22,360
♪In the mortal world jade shatters,
tears of blood run dry♪

202
00:11:22,738 --> 00:11:25,113
♪Ask again of love's poison,
in whose arms will I sleep♪

203
00:11:25,399 --> 00:11:27,118
♪How can I bear a sweet dream♪

204
00:11:27,118 --> 00:11:28,790
♪Turning into doom♪
(Wedding)

205
00:11:29,573 --> 00:11:32,166
♪A path full of thorns,
time won't wait♪

206
00:11:32,191 --> 00:11:36,319
♪I fear this life won't grant us
tender days together♪

207
00:11:36,907 --> 00:11:38,876
♪I don't regret that vow♪

208
00:11:38,900 --> 00:11:42,331
♪Luckily, the phoenix has fallen
into my heart♪
